\title{Inference intervention coordinates}
\tag{ftip}
\tag{dynamic-compute}

\p{A context intervention is a change to what a fixed model can attend to
while it generates a rollout. The intervention is meaningful only after the
prompt law, decoding rule, token budget, and retained-state rule are named.}

